<title>CHINA: TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results on Thursday</p>
<p>in the Shanghai Open men's tennis tournament (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Oleg Orgodov (Uzbekistan) 3-6 6-0</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat 3-Filip De Wulf (Belgium) 6-3</p>
<p>4-6 7-5</p>
<p>4-Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Lars Jonsson (Sweden) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Gerard Solves (France) beat Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) 7-5</p>
<p>7-6(7-5)</p>
<p>Jereme Golmard (France) beat Thierry Champion (France) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Leander Paes (India) beat Tomas Nydahl (Sweden) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>8-Alexander Volkov (Russia) beat Eyal Ran (Israel) 6-7(4-7) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
</text>
